{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "d548a6cc6358f7e9cc5fe6ad2534ee7d320cc9c59c03db41673e805b4308f5f5", "ja": "星たちの思い", "zh": "群星的心愿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "79c8247be9d72d28fc5974e4413f745d36114f3e819bb9b1befa665c271a7b61", "ja": "特番数日前。貴音と司会をするアナウンサー\nが出演困難となり、手伝いを申し出る春香と\n伊織。だが、貴音は問題ないと断る。ひとり\n声をあげられなかったと悔やむ雪歩の背中を\n春香と伊織が押し、貴音の元へ向かわせる。", "zh": "特别节目播出前几天。与贵音共同主持的播音员因故难以出演，春香和伊织主动提出帮忙。但贵音表示没问题，拒绝了她们。后悔自己没能独自站出来的雪步，在春香和伊织的鼓励下，前往贵音身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7d042b589d599f3710fc689dc24c408fe680299944883eab8840af036f91f540", "ja": "（音楽特番『シンギングスター』生放送が間近に迫った\nある日、局からトラブル発生との連絡が入った……）", "zh": "（距离音乐特别节目《Singing Star》直播还有几天时，电视台传来了发生意外的消息……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "0cf2d03b2cfaf87320b8d1109e681983db7f39a53e40b2693a8bb06bff5ae29d", "ja": "つまり……司会のアナウンサーの方が、\n出られなくなった、ということですね？", "zh": "也就是说……担任主持的播音员，没法出场了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fa386e42de3f534b86b7400cd150c2d1de5b89c2f7b23fad711d76f67df666f8", "ja": "ああ、急病で入院されたそうなんだ。\n命に別状はないみたいだけど……。", "zh": "是啊，听说他因为突发疾病住院了。\n好像没有生命危险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "49db788d43fbbd562ed241f2fe1b3f87f12a057534d9a86f57f134d4fa26772b", "ja": "それで、どうなるわけ？\n番組側は、なんて言って来てるの？", "zh": "那接下来要怎么办？\n节目组那边怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "afcb9cb6c0463ea59a4053b27d63e174543d09983bb81a4ff738a7a0d65197d1", "ja": "今、急いで代役を探してるって話なんだけど、\n流石に急すぎて難航してるらしい。", "zh": "听说他们现在正在赶紧寻找替补，但实在太突然了，似乎进展得并不顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5581383451f2e79967ebee12bd075e75f7e0f745f44eb19e82ac235730fd42db", "ja": "それで、貴音一人での進行をお願いできないかって、\n相談が来てるんだ。", "zh": "所以，他们来找我商量，能不能请贵音一个人主持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "85489e14a9b6af0aa9901d1b5f33e9bf059755207b1b62fdd106061141634dcd", "ja": "ええっ！？　あの番組、4時間以上ありますけど……\nず、ずっとですか？　台本もあんなに分厚いのに？", "zh": "诶！？那个节目可是有4个小时以上呢……\n要、要一直由她一个人来吗？台本还那么厚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "dc3a6fbe9dc0a204d697c2eaa4ec338700b3f874cb13cfc6077785f612811d7b", "ja": "いくらなんでも、貴音ひとりじゃ\n無理があるんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "再怎么说，光靠贵音一个人\n也未免太勉强了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "89b4b49c6866c6104ac61a34e1ad3abc75ca074408fa99648cd1c43c55a176e7", "ja": "いえ、台本はすべて頭に入っています。\nですから……、問題ありません。", "zh": "不，我已经把剧本全部记在脑子里了。\n所以……没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4b00e218ba2cc7d75cdc6fed78008719a9da79a4a8e60bc62cc5b2e0dd429af8", "ja": "で、でも、四条さん……。", "zh": "可、可是，四条小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "961b55bac7b08324c6ce49bbe4f58690e0af246aac522b5cc3009aa828801beb", "ja": "雪歩、心配しないでください。いざとなれば\n私のらーめんとーくで、場を盛り上げてみせましょう。", "zh": "雪步，请不要担心。真到了关键时刻，我会用我的拉面闲谈把气氛活跃起来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b8baebf66c6f217224ee59f7f777cac8c36e83559517e4566ee8bd2c186bdf47", "ja": "い、いえ、それはいいんですけど、\nそうじゃなくて、その……。", "zh": "不、不用了，那倒没什么，\n只是并不是那个意思，就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7be042544d56ae2e204f4a9936c2a7f8c8ea29bf9e2f5afd3090cf522b040350", "ja": "……貴音がいいなら引き受けるよ。\nでも、本当にいいのか？", "zh": "……如果贵音觉得可以的话，我就接下了。\n但是，你真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "681500e1b55734c3843a110c9a6ab9f518e0f4e5519a9490638af8d01118038c", "ja": "私を信じてくださったからこそのご依頼なのでしょう。\n信頼に応えるのが私の務め……。", "zh": "正因为您相信我，才会把这件事托付给我吧。\n回应这份信任是我的职责……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "94a9e9dd8ca97d64460af85513c4084243d678a06408905f981ccb12e74cc9b7", "ja": "ならば私は、必ずや果たしてみせます。\nどうぞ安心してお任せください。", "zh": "既然如此，我一定会完成的。请放心交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "6dca7e96c98f6231a7373f3e6f6809ff9cd3b1e77afaa1160930fc5da2ef5ec3", "ja": "私なら……、大丈夫です。", "zh": "如果是我的话……没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f8dbf33f8b17289c1a6075ff77950452c64f8db55d946537911f38d5decfdba7", "ja": "四条さん……。", "zh": "四条小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f280e1d0f7f7ede771af9e8a812aa936d4d3d80bbcf25ac0f618323f23f4c970", "ja": "……わかった。先方には連絡しておく。", "zh": "……明白了。我会联系对方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f0a3ce4fffb78bd605ceaa5f8321c29d2e357d656f079444a1e3980f32e418d0", "ja": "……。\nあ、あの……。", "zh": "……。\n那、那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1c14fbf7b7c2e6fb7163d0b85ad70fba048e5b4047694901738fffb9e344aa1b", "ja": "……。\nい、いえ。やっぱり、なんでも……。", "zh": "……。\n没、没什么。果然还是算了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "aae44c0c333c178d1d4391c373b6b6913675adde85ebf090c51bad6c82e2f5b5", "ja": "あ、あの！　{$P$}さん、貴音さん。\n司会、私たちも手伝うっていうのはどうですか？", "zh": "啊、那个！{$P$}先生、贵音。\n主持工作也让我们一起帮忙，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "d99cc06c42fc9cc224b2262fa3cef66a0c8dbd1a75044affd8d8b266950316e8", "ja": "そうよ、貴音ひとりに全部なんて、無茶振りすぎるわ。\n『ステラ』みんなでやればいいじゃない！", "zh": "就是嘛，让贵音一个人包办全部也太强人所难了。『Stella』大家一起做不就好了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "cbef23eee648aab4ddf6703dbfaa583ff596448895f5f234bddbb592c500c6e7", "ja": "それはそれで4人の連携が必要になる。レッスンも\n合わせられてないのに、そこまではちょっと……。", "zh": "那样也需要4人的配合。连练习都还没能协调好，要做到那一步还是有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "753f2f89b737866755d8ae3293a5fd1cc26b1a90fb74661dd077f4442e98458c", "ja": "……春香、伊織。お気遣いありがとうございます。\nですが皆を煩わせるのは、私の本意ではありません。", "zh": "……春香、伊织。谢谢你们的体贴。\n但是给大家添麻烦，并非我的本意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "2e1a7da1390b7cfb4df6feb1746c28b09cefd4e19575d51b06c52c92cdaf9298", "ja": "私は本当に、一人で大丈夫です。\nですから……どうか、ご心配なく。", "zh": "我真的一个人也没关系。所以……还请不要担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "336f23f904db6fe192e79c80bd470c54a90db33609f33e4529e95d5c708c5d68", "ja": "……はぁ。", "zh": "……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "1378a18d2e4effda52cf3234027ca6ecc97118ecf3aca5cac397979a4887abf0", "ja": "あ、雪歩！　よかった、ここにいたんだ。", "zh": "啊，雪步！太好了，原来你在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "350d6c79fb667ee4c6632f58a10c7293027ae59a217a51b4723764ef58f714ac", "ja": "春香ちゃん、伊織ちゃん……。\nあっ、ごめんなさい！　もう休憩終わり……？", "zh": "春香、伊织……\n啊，对不起！休息时间已经结束了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "6fac2a1fe12c5e319510bec7930aad7b35cce7ac53b376c02873028af9b0c1b5", "ja": "違うわよ。雪歩が落ち込んでるんじゃないかって\n思ったから、探しに来たの。", "zh": "才不是呢。我是觉得雪步可能情绪低落了，所以才来找她的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1033_004yuk", "source_sha256": "742364156b6fa562e8ab72d434d4b1cd33b7641c67c099adb1031b89880e7edb", "ja": "えっ……ええと……。", "zh": "诶……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "e5b3d5d48af6f1a5bd8e0568d074b1218d6f40e427caba8f3bb6e57db7cdcc30", "ja": "さっきはごめんね。雪歩の台詞、取っちゃって。", "zh": "刚才对不起啊。把雪步的台词抢走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1035_004yuk", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1036_001har", "source_sha256": "ae9a592f49a019ec98add5188175652381d76cd294f55245cd58c62887221eb6", "ja": "貴音さんを手伝いたいって。\n雪歩が言いかけてくれてたから言えたの。ありがとう！", "zh": "是因为雪步刚才正想说想帮贵音，我才说出来的。谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a512e5645bbc9cf4ffae76e9b874b6d1ff4f5ea72c207590366e5663c6d6d202", "ja": "そ、そんな！　私は結局、言えなくて……\nふたりに言ってもらっちゃって……。", "zh": "没、没那回事！我最后还是没能说出口……  \n结果还是让你们两个人替我说了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1038_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9253d9ed9df5d35561fe91157922ac01f10f13daf6ffb7ab5e83c6f888c6ba6e", "ja": "それで……私、まだ全然ダメダメだなぁって思って、\n情けなくて……うう……。", "zh": "所以……我觉得自己果然还是差得远呢，\n真是没用……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1039_007ior", "source_sha256": "464ca3a6c21d9f0c5eadc7c0f8bbac34e9c377d173dd3cc6e8a87384be2cd53f", "ja": "べ、別に雪歩の代わりに言ったわけじゃないわ。\n私も手伝おうと思っただけなんだから。", "zh": "我、我才不是替雪步说的呢。\n只是想着也帮帮忙而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1040_007ior", "source_sha256": "abdb15b71f303b562c5171124b8a7e5ad463652d6e1972e133a3bbd04a6623bc", "ja": "まあ雪歩は、手伝うなんていったら失礼かも、\nとか思ったのかもしれないけどっ。", "zh": "不过，雪步也许是觉得说要帮忙什么的有点失礼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1041_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2d2093e3a10496a1130ab4011ac85c95eae0720791b15e8ed933344d0c8991d7", "ja": "う……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1042_007ior", "source_sha256": "1b998b56e465e3e5228bd47de56aa36a1d7d40c9fc468bff88a9bb61d7d382c3", "ja": "私だって、貴音なら本当に、\nこのままひとりでやり切っちゃうと思うわ。でも……。", "zh": "我……我也觉得，要是贵音的话，真的会就这样一个人把事情做完的。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1043_001har", "source_sha256": "32863ece82673ba875ca0da7eafc8ed1c45d0e0d136db9f25b4e4808ea683ac4", "ja": "うん……ひとりでできるからって、\nひとりで平気なわけじゃないと思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得就算一个人能做到，\n也不代表一个人就不会难受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1045_001har", "source_sha256": "65064c9899078961b1e932ee407843d842762dc9481ae8033d837156fd76d0f4", "ja": "それに……誰かの手を取りたいときは、取っちゃって\nいいんじゃないかな。私なんて、いつもそうしてるし♪", "zh": "而且……想牵起某人的手时，就牵起来不就好了吗？我一直都是这么做的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1046_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1bba4cf1e6e016d4b22f36495386128d528d949dc8d603f47ca67226727ef78c", "ja": "春香ちゃん……。\n……。", "zh": "春香……。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1047_007ior", "source_sha256": "a9486421252f8f94fbbdbee4e6b32a63214ba31c436b807c072f6377dc9f075a", "ja": "私と春香は、貴音とレッスンのスケジュールが合わない\nくらいだから、やっぱり手伝うのは無理だけど。", "zh": "我和春香连和贵音一起上课的时间都对不上，所以果然还是没法帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1048_001har", "source_sha256": "88911f257a96aee9c3b5482b96fef9824dd8aa6e0fd94fc225c54e66ff55a11f", "ja": "雪歩、けっこう貴音さんと一緒のレッスンだよね？\nいいなぁ～、うらやましいなぁ～♪", "zh": "雪步，你经常和贵音小姐一起上课吧？\n真好啊～好羡慕啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_04_1049_004yuk", "source_sha256": "77cd9e134ed46c4caab4a51ddde606f9ea550c65d7e14c98fad7b10f6387364a", "ja": "……えへへ。ありがとう。\n私……、私……、行ってくるね！", "zh": "……嘿嘿。谢谢你。\n我……我……去了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
